            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[The Now status summary is now a compact, fixed-height strip that remains visible when session details open or close. Selecting a session no longer removes the summary or shifts the list upward.

Search has moved to a smaller field in the window toolbar; ⌘F, Escape, clear search, and Back to Now remain available. Select sessions is in the toolbar’s ellipsis menu, with bulk controls shown only during selection.
]]></description>
